{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50420","headline":"三二 · 王梵志","name":"三二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男年七十八，（一本作「十七八」。\n）莫遣倚街衢。\n若不行奸盗，相构即榻（一本作「摺」）蒲。\n（「榻蒲」，张锡厚改作「樗蒲」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}